OL,3,GNEWSAFormer PC sentenced for on-duty
OL,4,Aassault of woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former West Midlands Police officer
OL,7,Fhas been given a community order after
OL,8,Fbeing convicted of assaulting a woman
OL,9,Fduring an arrest.
OL,11,FCalum Brand, who was a PC, pulled the
OL,12,Fwoman's hair, pinned her down and
OL,13,Felbowed her in the face during a
OL,14,Fstruggle in a communal stairwell at a
OL,15,Fproperty in Halesowen, Dudley, the
OL,16,FIndependent Office for Police Conduct
OL,17,F(IOPC) said.
OL,19,FThe 27-year-old had denied assault by
OL,20,Fbeating but was convicted at Nottingham
OL,21,FMagistrates' Court on 15 July.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
